00:06:58.518 --> 00:07:00.820 size:88% position:44%
Because these are really
intense fans, you know?

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:03.956
-Yes.
-Cartoon, comic book, that fans,

00:07:03.956 --> 00:07:05.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
those are huge fans.
You know well.

00:07:05.324 --> 00:07:07.660 align:start size:94% position:6%
You've produced
animated shows before.

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:09.295 align:start size:94% position:6%
And especially, like,
a legacy show like this.

00:07:09.295 --> 00:07:10.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, it's like,
"Oh, this is great."

00:07:10.663 --> 00:07:13.032 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, then, it was announce
about a month ago

00:07:13.032 --> 00:07:16.869
