00:07:19.272 --> 00:07:20.773 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They weren't happy
with the change?

00:07:20.773 --> 00:07:22.475 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-They were not happy.

00:07:22.475 --> 00:07:24.877 align:start size:94% position:6%
There was a lot of, like,
"So, not Velma."

00:07:24.877 --> 00:07:26.312 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, those kind of tweets
-Right.

00:07:26.312 --> 00:07:30.216
-"Not the classic Velma
that I'm always thinking about."

00:07:30.216 --> 00:07:31.851 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I just -- First of all
I didn't know

00:07:31.851 --> 00:07:35.455
