00:07:38.891 --> 00:07:39.625 size:84% position:42% line:92%
I think she probably --

00:07:39.625 --> 00:07:41.527 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the "Scooby-Doo" universe
she probably thought

00:07:41.527 --> 00:07:42.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
no one was paying attentio
to her at all.

00:07:42.929 --> 00:07:45.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, it's like,
she's such a great character

00:07:45.264 --> 00:07:46.065 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
She's so smart.

00:07:46.065 --> 00:07:48.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
