00:09:13.619 --> 00:09:14.120 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And it's just --

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:17.290 align:start size:94% position:6%
So we have a lot of --
which is nice about the show

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:18.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
