really young writers.

00:09:18.824 --> 00:09:19.892 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And we have, like --

00:09:19.892 --> 00:09:21.360 align:start size:94% position:6%
we let the actors
help us too.

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:22.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's great.
-Because it's really --

00:09:22.828 --> 00:09:24.397 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Because, I guess, yeah,
